63.steps:
1. After following steps in Test Case 62;
2. From DHCP server, choose one interface (x0) and reduce range to a single lease on this interface;
3. Place two clients on the interface;
4. Verify only one client could get lease on this interface;
5. Verify all clients on other interfaces could get leases successfully;
6. Do release/renew on each client, verify clients get leases correctly;
7. perform step 2) on other NAT interfaces each time and followed by steps 3) to 6), verify DHCP server behave health

