67.steps:
1. Configure a few DHCP entries(5 entries, each with 1 or 2 lease address pool) with lease time less than 30 minutes;
2. Configure multiple clients to use up all the IP addresses;
3. DHCP Server should show no available leases;
4. Disconnect all clients after the lease is obtained;
5. Approx. after 30 minutes, available leases should show number of IP address in the DHCP entry

